# Academic &quot;Mestizaje&quot;: Embracing Hispanicity in the Humanities at Hispanic Serving Institutions

**Authors:** Castro Samayoa, Andrés, Gasman, Marybeth, Gonzalez, Natalie, Milian, Polet

## Abstract
Through a combination of large-scale data analysis and analysis of culturally responsive ways of embracing Latino students, we provide insight on the work of three Hispanic Serving Institutions in the humanities.

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ1238430

